---
import Button from '../Button.astro';
---
<section class="cta" id="cta">
  <div class="cta__panel">
    <img class="cta__bg" src="/assets/cta-sunset.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="cta__overlay"></div>
    <div class="cta__content">
      <h2 class="cta__title">立即告别晚高峰卡顿与断流。<br /><em>体验 2.5Gbps IEPL 物理专线</em></h2>
      <p class="cta__lede">
        加入 50,000+ 跨境出海团队、海外科研人员与重度 AI 开发者行列。使用光速云专属优惠码【AMM】，年付折合约 8 元/月起，亦有 147 永久不限时套餐可选。
      </p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <Button
          href="https://sahude.gsyvipaff.com/#/?code=keqgvT5Y"
          label="立即前往光速云特惠开通 (码: AMM)"
          variant="primary"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored noopener"
        />
        <Button href="/airports" label="查看 42 家机场评测库" variant="secondary" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
